    "updated_at": "2017-09-27T16:16:13Z",
    "body": "What is wrong with contenteditable element? That would be a fresh, standardized restart, separate from the buggy, browser specific contenteditable attribute which is from implementation point of view rather horrible.\r\nI don't understand:\r\n> But then that is a whole can of worms itself.\r\n\r\n",
