    "updated_at": "2017-09-28T07:37:24Z",
    "body": "I don't think you can meaningfully separate the codebase like that, especially if you effectively need to support the same complexity (nested editing hosts, etc.). Trying to maintain two editing codebases forever is going to be a lot of trouble.",
