    "created_at": "2017-09-28T21:03:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-28T21:03:10Z",
    "body": "IMO this also ought to work with plain text boxes like `textarea`.  Many applications will be perfectly happy with plain text contents, but also want to influence the virtual keyboard.  I expect even a shiny new contenteditable implementation will still have many complexities and pitfalls compared to `textarea`, and I don't think we should drive plaintext use cases to it.",
