    "updated_at": "2017-09-28T21:13:28Z",
    "body": "I agree with aelias.. and that is why I want to add inputmode (and [inputmode-action](https://github.com/dtapuska/action-hint)) to inputs and content-editable.\r\n\r\nBut because of the design of contenteditable it means I need to expose it on HTMLElement.",
